{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "841617f5-9533-8de6-b36b-8883606e31c3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:48:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning, Kevin. Walter Sherman here. I've got a rental property out on Old Beach Road and the wind left me a yard full of branches. Nothing dramatic. Just a lot of sticks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sticks. Yeah, we get a lot of those calls this time of year. What's the address, Walter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "55 Old Beach Road. Over on the Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 55 Old Beach Road. And just to be clear, nothing's come down on the house or the road, right? This is just cleanup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, just cleanup. Branches in the yard, some leaves mixed in, a few bigger pieces. Nobody's in danger, the house is fine. I just want to know when brush pickup is and how you want it bundled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me pull up the schedule for that area. Hang on a sec. [pause] Okay, so I'm writing this down, brush goes out on your regular collection day, and it has to be out by early that morning, not the night before if you can help it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:45:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early meaning what, six? Seven?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Say by seven, to be safe. And for bundling, tie the branches with natural twine, nothing plastic, and keep the bundles manageable, like about three or four feet long so the guys can lift them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three or four feet. So I'm cutting these down. Fine. I've got a saw that's been waiting for work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There you go. Stack them neat, all facing the same way, and put them at the curb. Loose leaves, those go in paper yard waste bags, not plastic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paper bags. Okay. How thick can the branches be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally nothing real thick. If you've got something that's like a log, that's probably a different conversation. I'd cut it small or call back and we'll sort it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing like a log. Maybe wrist-sized at the worst. I'll keep it modest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:46:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wrist-sized is fine. So that's twine, short bundles, paper bags for leaves, out by seven on your day. Did you want me to look up your day for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. I always forget which one's which. I've got tenants who'd tell me, but they'd also tell me a lot of other things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. [pause] Okay, for Old Beach Road your pickup is Friday. So that's tomorrow, if you can get it all done today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Well, that's a motivator. I'll go out there this afternoon and see how far I get. Otherwise it waits a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works too. Nobody's going to come after you for a week of sticks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'm saving money where I can this month. I'm even putting off a haircut to save a few bucks. Gonna look like a shrub by New Year's. Blends in with the yard work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, you'll match the brush pile. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Appreciate it, Kevin. You made that easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime, Walter. Good luck with the saw. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Thanks."
    }
  ],
